================================================================================
Phan phai sinh — ghi cong tac gia goc
================================================================================

<PROJECT> la ban phai sinh (derivative work) tu:

    Roblox Account Manager
    Truoc do: RBX Alt Manager
    Tac gia: ic3w0lf22
    Nguon:  https://github.com/ic3w0lf22/Roblox-Account-Manager
    Giay phep: GNU General Public License v3.0

Toan bo thu muc RAM_Source/ trong repo nay la ban sao nguyen trang cua tac pham tren, duoc giu lai
lam nguon tham chieu cho viec tai lap hanh vi tuong thich. Phan code Rust trong crates/ duoc viet
moi, nhung tai lap dac ta hanh vi, dinh dang file, giao thuc va giao dien API cua tac pham goc.

Theo giay phep GPL-3.0, <PROJECT> cung duoc phat hanh duoi GPL-3.0. Xem LICENSE.

================================================================================
Nhung thu KHONG duoc phat hanh kem
================================================================================

- handle.exe (Sysinternals, Microsoft). Co dieu khoan cap phep rieng, khong duoc redistribute.
  RAM_Source/ co chua file nay chi vi do la ban sao nguyen trang cua nguon tham chieu.
  <PROJECT> KHONG dung handle.exe — xem ROADMAP.md muc M3.
- CefSharp / CEF va cac ban Chromium tai ve: khong nhung san, chi tai khi nguoi dung yeu cau.
  Xem docs/BROWSER.md.

================================================================================
Thuong hieu
================================================================================

"Roblox" la thuong hieu cua Roblox Corporation. Du an nay khong lien ket, khong duoc tai tro va
khong duoc Roblox Corporation chung thuc. Ten "Roblox" khong xuat hien trong ten san pham, ten
crate, bundle identifier hay ten mien cua <PROJECT> — chi dung trong van ban mo ta de noi ro
san pham dung de lam gi.
